		<title>By: Elizabeth "Elsa" Weber-Fraley</title>
		<link>http://remembrance.sufipaths.net/?page_id=191&#038;cpage=1#comment-6503</link>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Elizabeth "Elsa" Weber-Fraley]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Sat, 27 Nov 2010 17:44:50 +0000</pubDate>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://remembranceproject.wordpress.com/?page_id=191#comment-6503</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[Humor and laughter has always been a saving Grace for me.  And when I was initiated by Pir Vilayat at age 19 (34 years ago) Pir Vilayat gave me a great gift.  He gave me a laughing initiation!  It was at a camp in Florida (the one where it snowed) and I had to walk into the forest a short distance to find Pir Vilayat waiting there.  When I arrived he held out his hands and burst into the most uproarious laugther.  We laughed and laughed for five minutes straight.  It was a cleansing and healing and life-affirming laughter that spoke directly to my Soul.

After our laughter organically subsided, he gave me his blessing with so much reverence.  

Thank you, Pir Vilayat, for sharing with me &quot;the light of the Divine Humor.&quot;
Elizabeth &quot;Elsa&quot; Weber]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Humor and laughter has always been a saving Grace for me.  And when I was initiated by Pir Vilayat at age 19 (34 years ago) Pir Vilayat gave me a great gift.  He gave me a laughing initiation!  It was at a camp in Florida (the one where it snowed) and I had to walk into the forest a short distance to find Pir Vilayat waiting there.  When I arrived he held out his hands and burst into the most uproarious laugther.  We laughed and laughed for five minutes straight.  It was a cleansing and healing and life-affirming laughter that spoke directly to my Soul.</p>
<p>After our laughter organically subsided, he gave me his blessing with so much reverence.  </p>
<p>Thank you, Pir Vilayat, for sharing with me &#8220;the light of the Divine Humor.&#8221;<br />
Elizabeth &#8220;Elsa&#8221; Weber</p>
]]></content:encoded>
