		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://remembranceproject.wordpress.com/?page_id=191#comment-19</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[Today in Boston, Transpersonal Drama Therapists in training entered an experience of the angelic planes through meditation and enactment as students experienced their purpose for coming to the earth. I remember my first darshan with Pir Vilayat as he told me that I was there to help him and would have the angelic planes revealed to me. I so cherish the reality of that as I have been able to bring that experience into my work with mureeds and therapist colleagues and students. I feel blessed to have been given a name that helps me remember that transmission.
 
I pray, Pir Vilayat, that you are at peace in your heavenly home.
 
Love and Blessings,
Saphira]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Today in Boston, Transpersonal Drama Therapists in training entered an experience of the angelic planes through meditation and enactment as students experienced their purpose for coming to the earth. I remember my first darshan with Pir Vilayat as he told me that I was there to help him and would have the angelic planes revealed to me. I so cherish the reality of that as I have been able to bring that experience into my work with mureeds and therapist colleagues and students. I feel blessed to have been given a name that helps me remember that transmission.</p>
<p>I pray, Pir Vilayat, that you are at peace in your heavenly home.</p>
<p>Love and Blessings,<br />
Saphira</p>
